s-again-need-some-advice.1785303/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228084815/https://looksmax.org/threads/thinking-about-using-any-form-of-cannabis-again-need-some-advice.1785303/"},{"title":"I'm gonna take a puff of cannabis and see if I feel better","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/im-gonna-take-a-puff-of-cannabis-and-see-if-i-feel-better.612095/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221129142731/https://looksmax.org/threads/im-gonna-take-a-puff-of-cannabis-and-see-if-i-feel-better.612095/"},{"title":"The War on Drugs","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-war-on-drugs/265165","site":"T Nation · 1909 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Maybe SOME Good News from the FDA","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/maybe-some-good-news-from-the-fda/224450","site":"T Nation · 708 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Hemp and Marijuana Are the Answer","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/hemp-and-marijuana-are-the-answer/206153","site":"T Nation · 178 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Marijuana Use","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/marijuana-use/252219","site":"T Nation · 116 posts · 2019"},{"title":"What Would You Suggest for Insomnia?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/what-would-you-suggest-for-insomnia/262610","site":"T Nation · 53 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Supplement for Sleep?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/supplement-for-sleep/246353","site":"T Nation · 19 posts · 2018"},{"title":"A Marijuana User's Guide to Supplements","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/a-marijuana-users-guide-to-supplements/289221","site":"T Nation · 11 posts · 2024"},{"title":"Honest Advice About Marijuana","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/honest-advice-about-marijuana/284215","site":"T Nation · 1 posts · 2019"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"Prenatal cannabis exposure associated with mental disorders in children","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32817466","site":"Hacker News","score":381,"comments":360,"year":2022},{"title":"Given Choice, Patients Will Choose Cannabis Over Prescribed Opioids","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=13760598","site":"Hacker News","score":412,"comments":214,"year":2017},{"title":"Younger cannabis users have reduced brain function, finds largest study yet","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=42873697","site":"Hacker News","score":308,"comments":278,"year":2025}],"web":[{"title":"Cannabidiol - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannabidiol"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Sleep & recovery","chain":["Faster sleep onset","Better rested, more recovery","Fresher skin and eyes"],"effect":"indirect","text":"Some users take cannabis or CBD to fall asleep faster, so they wake better rested and recover more from training, which shows up as fresher skin and eyes. Small clinical trials have looked at cannabinoids for insomnia."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Cannabis and cannabidiol (CBD) are used by some people to help with sleep onset. The only FDA-approved CBD medicine, Epidiolex (2018), is indicated for certain seizure disorders, not sleep [1].","Wikipedia states that CBD may help with pain, sleep and addiction but that clinical evidence is limited; it lists somnolence as common and insomnia as an adverse effect [1]."],"infobox":[["Compound","Cannabidiol (CBD) and THC"],["Approved CBD drug","Epidiolex (US 2018, seizure indications) [1]"],["Legal status","Varies; hemp-derived CBD with 0.3% THC or less is unscheduled federally in the US [1]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Adverse effects and regulation","paras":["CBD side effects are dose-related and include somnolence, sedation, fatigue, diarrhea and appetite changes [1]. The FDA has raised concerns about liver toxicity, interactions with prescription drugs, gastrointestinal problems and effects on alertness and mood, and in later updates about long-term effects, pregnancy and male fertility [1].","Product quality studies found labeling problems: a 2017 analysis of online US products found 69% mislabeled, and a 2020 FDA study of 147 products found half contained THC [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["Registered trials include a phase 2 trial of cannabinoids as a treatment for insomnia in major depression (n=14, completed, started 2023) [2]. No results are reported in the registry entry cited here, and no appearance-related studies were found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1940","event":"CBD first studied [1]."},{"year":"1963","event":"Structure and stereochemistry of CBD determined [1]."},{"year":"2018","event":"FDA approves Epidiolex [1]."}],"refs":[{"title":"Cannabidiol","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannabidiol","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Cannabinoids as a Treatment for Insomnia in Major Depression (NCT05041647)","url":"https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT05041647","source":"ClinicalTrials.gov","year":2023,"type":"trial"}],"studies":[{"title":"Cannabinoids as a Treatment for Insomnia in Major Depression (NCT05041647)","url":"https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT05041647","source":"ClinicalTrials.gov","year":2023,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Thinking about using any form of cannabis again. Need some advice","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thinking-about-using-any-form-of-cannabis-again-need-some-advice.1785303/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228084815/https://looksmax.org/threads/thinking-about-using-any-form-of-cannabis-again-need-some-advice.1785303/"},{"title":"I'm gonna take a puff of cannabis and see if I feel better","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/im-gonna-take-a-puff-of-cannabis-and-see-if-i-feel-better.612095/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221129142731/https://looksmax.org/threads/im-gonna-take-a-puff-of-cannabis-and-see-if-i-feel-better.612095/"},{"title":"The War on Drugs","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-war-on-drugs/265165","site":"T Nation · 1909 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Maybe SOME Good News from the FDA","url":"https://t-nation.co